Ques10:
Your ESP32 must simultaneously interface with a DHT11 sensor, an ultrasonic sensor, an OLED display, a relay module, and a soil moisture
sensor. What hardware or software conflicts could occur, and how would you solve them? 
Ans – When connecting multiple devices to an ESP32, problems like GPIO pin conflicts, high power consumption, and communication issues may
occur. These can be solved by using different GPIO pins, an external power supply for high-power devices, and proper programming to manage
all sensors efficiently. 
